        <!-- =====================================
             THE PROJECT
        ====================================== -->

        <section class="resource-description">

            <div class="resource-description-label">

                <span>01</span>

                THE<br>
                PROJECT

            </div>


            <div class="resource-description-content">

                <p>
                    How do we collaborate better in virtual spaces?
                    And how do we create virtual partner communities
                    where every voice can be heard?
                </p>


                <p>
                    The Mestenhauser Institute for International
                    Collaboration led the creation of the
                    <strong>Manual for Virtual Interaction</strong>
                    to support collaboration in international
                    projects across European University Alliances.
                </p>


                <p>
                    I contributed my expertise to the development
                    of the manual, particularly around the design
                    of inclusive and collaborative virtual spaces.
                </p>


                <div class="resource-note">

                    <strong>
                        THE GOAL
                    </strong>

                    <p>
                        Create virtual spaces that support meaningful
                        participation, collaboration, and dialogue
                        across institutions and contexts.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>



        <!-- =====================================
             TWO SECTIONS
        ====================================== -->

        <section class="manual-sections section">

            <div class="section-label">
                02 · THE MANUAL
            </div>


