                    </span>


                    <p class="manual-card-label">
                        PEDAGOGICAL SECTION
                    </p>


                    <h2>
                        DESIGN<br>
                        FOR<br>
                        <span>EVERY VOICE.</span>
                    </h2>


                    <p>
                        Provides insights into the design principles
                        of an inclusive, democratic, and highly
                        collaborative virtual space.
                    </p>


                    <ul>

                        <li>
                            Inclusive participation
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Democratic collaboration
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Intentional virtual interaction
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Supporting diverse voices
                        </li>

                    </ul>

                </article>



                <!-- TECHNICAL -->

                <article class="manual-card technical-card">

                    <span class="manual-card-number">
