                    </p>


                    <h2>
                        MAKE THE<br>
                        SPACE<br>
                        <span>WORK.</span>
                    </h2>


                    <p>
                        Provides practical guidance for setting up
                        virtual spaces and supporting partner
                        collaboration.
                    </p>


                    <ul>

                        <li>
                            Microsoft Teams setup
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Ethical IT use
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Virtual space management
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            Supporting project partners
                        </li>

                    </ul>

