        <!-- =====================================
             MY CONTRIBUTION
        ====================================== -->

        <section class="manual-contribution">

            <div class="manual-contribution-number">
                03
            </div>


            <div class="manual-contribution-content">

                <div class="example-label">
                    MY CONTRIBUTION
                </div>


                <h2>
                    PEDAGOGY<br>
                    MEETS<br>
                    <span>PRACTICE.</span>
                </h2>


                <p>
                    My contribution to the project brought together
                    my experience in online education, instructional
                    design, COIL, Virtual Exchange, and faculty
                    development.
                </p>


                <p>
                    The manual reflects an approach I value deeply:
                    virtual collaboration is not only a technical
                    challenge. It is a learning and human experience
                    that requires intentional design.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>



